  dialogueLines:
  - subtitleText: 'Here rests Tosia Grunberg. She died on April 23, 1945, shortly
      after liberation. Fellow survivors laid her to rest. As a book describes: ''The
      girls filled the grave and recited Kaddish for their friend''.'
